'Chief Mum Rimmon, Chief Dun Wolfarch, Chief Dark Berith, Chief Lich jel'),(330,_binary 'This feature is not supported yet.'),(331,_binary 'No wonder it\'s so noisy outside... Did you get through those horrible traps to arrive here?'),(332,_binary 'Please don\'t be mistaken. Although I have settled here, I\'m not clear the origin of those traps.'),(333,_binary 'I\'m also obssessed by the traps... it\'s a mystery who created them.'),(334,_binary 'Wait, there must be something to appear. Is it you guys who do this? Do you guys want to hurt me?'),(335,_binary 'Don\'t you do that? Anyway, you are all strong warriors.'),(336,_binary 'You guys make me think about a girl named Jendaluke'),(337,_binary 'Her power is the greatest. I was getting to respect her when she visited me for saving her nation.'),(338,_binary 'She is so young to be here for saving the nation.'),(339,_binary 'Why are you guys visiting me? You should know that it\'s very dangerous here.'),(340,_binary 'Now I\'m so headache that I cannot help you for the moment.'),(341,_binary 'Well, you should not have ejected these guests who were asking for help. It\'s so rude.'),(342,_binary 'Please don\'t blame me. The old make such mistakes sometimes. After a while, watch the ballon go up,hahaha!'),(343,_binary 'Great, wonderful! Let me see.'),(344,_binary 'I really cannot stand the fragrance from your guys.'),(345,_binary 'It\'s a humiliation that I\'m defeated by you guys.'),(346,_binary 'It\'s dangerous here. Get out of here... Oh, I can\'t hold on.'),(347,_binary 'Well! I felt so bad... You guys\' expressions are so ridiculous. I\'d like to play more tricks on you more.'),(348,_binary 'Stop! Stop attack! I didn\'t mean to. Well... I thought everything was well, but evilness still exists, cannot get rid of.'),(349,_binary 'Things which have happened cannot be redeemed. Do you want to make a compromise with me now ?'),(350,_binary 'The power which Jendaluke wanted to have... Don\'t you want to know? '),(351,_binary 'Then, Jendaluke refused my request. However, I believe you will not absolutely.'),(352,_binary 'Then, I gave her the power she wanted at the expense of her flesh and blood. I don\'t think the requirement is high.'),(353,_binary 'I was hurt badly so I decided to cut off all connections with outside. That\'s why I designed all of these traps.'),(354,_binary 'I abandoned all my own glories!'),(355,_binary 'Look! I created lives with my power. You all can get renascence.'),(356,_binary 'Ah? What\'s wrong? Is it not enough? If no human child\'s blood, perfect life cannot be created!'),(357,_binary 'Once we had Jendaluke\'s blood... By the way, try some of your blood, although it\'s not that pure.'),(358,_binary 'I will creat perfect life. Your blood is flowing in my body, you guys should be feel proud.'),(359,_binary 'The blood of like you guys.... You don\'t need to feel sorry. I\'ll take care of everything. '),(360,_binary 'I really don\'t understand, why are you feeling so hopeful for life? Anyway, everybody will die, turning to dust'),(361,_binary 'Ask her who she is.'),(362,_binary 'You\'d better go back. It\'s good for you.'),(363,_binary 'I warned you, it\'s a dangerous place. Now, I\'m... Ah...'),(364,_binary 'Ahaha, the shell is finally removed.'),(365,_binary 'Magic was used for bringing you memorable things. But now, it seems no useful.'),(366,_binary 'Have you guys ever seen that? This is a real masterwork. Look at yourselves who are fighting with illusions, so poor.'),(367,_binary 'How\'s your feeling? Is it great to be tricked?'),(368,_binary 'No, please, please let me go!'),(369,_binary 'From now on, nothing is illusion.'),(370,_binary 'OK, follow me!'),(371,_binary 'I\'m tired of people who play double characters or things like just waiting for food.'),(372,_binary 'Only available for guild who\'s defending'),(373,_binary 'Permitted to join in the alliance'),(374,_binary 'Refused to join in the alliance.'),(375,_binary 'Permitted to quit the  alliance