¡º¸°Ú½À´Ï´Ù.'),(4202,_binary 'Ä«ÀÎ',_binary '³ª´Â ¿©±â E.V.E¿¡ ¾ô¸ÅÀÎ ¸öÀº ¾Æ´Ï¶ó³×. ´ÜÁö °´¿ø ¿¬±¸¿øÀÏ »ÓÀÌÁö.',''),(4203,_binary 'Ä«ÀÎ',_binary '´Ù¾çÇÑ ¸ÅÃ¼µéÀÇ Á¤º¸¸¦ ÃëÇÕÇØº¸¸é ¼¼»óÀÌ ¾ó¸¶³ª À½¸ð¿¡ °¡µæÂ÷ ÀÖ´ÂÁö ¾Ë ¼ö ÀÖ´Ù³×.',''),(4204,_binary 'Ä«ÀÎ',_binary '¼¼»óÀÇ ´ëºÎºÐÀÇ Á¶Á÷µéÀº ´Ù ¹ìÆÄÀÌ¾îµé°ú Á¶±Ý¾¿ ¿¬°üÀ» ¸Î°í ÀÖ´Ù´Â Á¶»ç°á°ú°¡ ³ª¿Ô´Ù³×.',''),(4205,_binary 'Ä«ÀÎ',_binary '¿©±â Ã¥µéÀ» Àß ÀÐ¾îº¸¸é ¹ìÆÄÀÌ¾îµé¿¡ ´ëÇØ¼­ À¢¸¸Å­À» ¾Ë ¼ö ÀÖ´Ù³×.',''),(4206,_binary 'Ä«ÀÎ',_binary 'Å¸³Ä°°Àº µþÀÌ ÀÖ´Ù¸é Á¤¸» ÁÁ°Ú³×. ¿¹»ÚÁö. ¶È¶ÈÇÏÁö. ±×·±µ¥ ¿Ö ¾ÆÁ÷ ¾ÖÀÎÀÌ ¾øÀ»±î?',''),(4207,_binary 'Ä«ÀÎ',_binary 'È¤½Ã ÀÓ¹«¸¦ ÇÏ´Ù°¡ ¿À·¡µÈ Ã¥µéÀ» ¹ß°ßÇÏ¸é ²À ³ª¿¡°Ô °¡Á®¿À°Ô³ª.',''),(4301,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'I am Tanya Serrano. How can I help you?',_binary 'There is something I would like to ask you.\r\n**I would like to take part in the virtual training system.\r\n**I want to look up weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.\r\n**I have come to learn a skill.'),(4302,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'What is it you would like to know about me?',_binary 'Tanya, what is it you do here?\r\n**How did you come to join E.V.E?\r\n**I want to look up weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.'),(4303,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'I handle information strategy within E.V.E. At the moment I am stationed at this temporary command post, helping Slayers look up weapons more easily. Have you heard how things stand in Eslanian? Go and see Deputy Commander Kaiser and he will give you a full briefing.',_binary 'How did you come to join E.V.E?\r\n**I want to look up weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.'),(4304,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'I once hacked into a CIA machine by chance and found a document marked as a state secret. What it contained was extraordinary: agents of the CIA entangled with vampires. Several of them were handling business during daylight hours on behalf of vampires who could not. There were transcripts of calls, ledgers, stacks of documents. Every click was a thrill. I kept reading, caught up in the thought that I had stumbled into something enormous, and then I was traced and my location was exposed. A careless mistake. People from a government agency came for me and bargained with me over what I had seen. They dug up a drug charge from two years earlier and threatened me with a life sentence. Joining E.V.E was the condition they offered, so I had little choice but to accept, and that is how I came to be here.',_binary 'Tanya, what is it you do here?\r\n**I want to look up weapon information. Could you help me?\r\n**It was good to meet you, Tanya.'),(4305,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'If you need to be issued a weapon, go and see Zach. He knows as much about weapons as any computer, so you will get plenty of information from him. Oh, and one more thing. To see how an item you are carrying is used, press TAB to open your inventory, then click the magnifier button at the bottom. Click the item you want to know about and a short description of its use will appear. Keep that in mind. Well then, I wish you luck.',_binary 'Goodbye.'),(4306,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Would you like to learn the Heal line, or the Enchant line?',_binary 'I will learn the Heal line.\r\n**I will learn the Enchant line.\r\n**Before skills, I would like to know what you do here.\r\n**I will learn skills later. But tell me, how did you come to join E.V.E?\r\n**Rather than training, could you help me look up weapon information?\r\n**I will learn skills later. It was good to meet you, Tanya.\r\n'),(4307,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Just call me Tanya.',''),(4308,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'A computer is only a computer. It is the person using it who is truly remarkable.',''),(4309,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Then again, plenty of people these days are worth less than a computer. A computer is at least honest.',''),(4310,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Use this computer if you want to look up weapon information.',''),(4311,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Do not forget to collect your weapon from Zach. I have seen more than a few people come back because they left without one.',''),(4312,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'You cannot call a script kiddie a hacker.',''),(4313,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'I am Tanya, in charge of information strategy.',''),(4314,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Ask me anything you do not know. I will give you as much information as I am able to.',''),(4315,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Have you had the general briefing from Deputy Commander Kaiser? If not, go and see him. He has a great deal of importance to tell you.',''),(4316,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Never forget to stay alert. I have seen plenty of people lose their heads for taking it easy.',''),(4317,_binary 'Å¸³Ä',_binary 'Zach knows as much about weapons as any computer. If you want to know more, going to him would help.',''),(4400,_binary '¸ÅÆ©',_binary 'ÀÌ ½ÃÄÝ½ºÅ°ÀÇ ±âÀå ¸ÅÆ© ±×·¹¾ö ¼Ò·ÉÀÌ´Ù. ÇÊ¿äÇÏ´Ù¸é ¸ËÀÌ¶ó ºÒ·¯µµ ÁÁÁö¸¸, ºñÇàÇÒ ¶§ ±âÀå´ÔÀÌ¶ó ºÎ¸£µµ·Ï. ÀÌµ¿ ÁöÁ¡Àº ¾îµðÀÎ°¡?',_binary 'Æä·Î³ª±¹µµ·Î °¡°í ½Í½À´Ï´Ù.\n		**ÀÚÀ¯´ë°áÁö´ë·Î °¡°í ½Í½À´Ï´Ù.\n		**ÇÇÀÇ ¼º¼­ÀÇ Â¡Ç¥¸¦ ºô¸®·¯ ¿Ô½À´Ï´Ù.\n		**ÇÇÀÇ ¼º¼­ÀÇ Â¡Ç¥¸¦ ¹Ý³³ÇÏ°Ú½À´Ï´Ù.\n		**±×³É µÑ·¯º¸°í ÀÖ´Â ÁßÀÔ´Ï´Ù. ¹æÇØÇØ¼­ ÁË¼ÛÇÕ´Ï´Ù.'),(4401,_binary '¸ÅÆ©',_binary 'º§Æ®¸¦ ´Ü´ÜÈ÷ ¸Å±æ. ÀÌ Çï±â¿¡´Â ¹®Â¦ÀÌ ¾øÀ¸´Ï ³¯¾Æ°¡ ¹ö¸±Áöµµ ¸ð¸£´Ï±ñ. ÇÏÇÏÇÏ!',''),(4402,_binary '¸ÅÆ©',_binary 'ÀÌÂø·ú½Ã¿¡´Â ¼ÒÀ½°ú Áøµ¿ÀÌ ½ÉÇÏ´Ï±ñ, ¸öÀ» ÀÇÀÚ¿¡ ¹ÐÂø½ÃÅ°°í ±Í¸¦ ¸·°í ÀÖµµ·Ï!',''),(4403,_binary '¸ÅÆ©',_binary 'ÀÌ°÷¿¡ Æ¯º°ÇÑ ¾ÈÀüÀåÄ¡´Â ¾øÀ¸´Ï, ÀÚ½ÅÀÌ ÀÚ½ÅÀÇ ¾ÈÀüÀ» ÁöÅ°µµ·Ï!',''),(4404,_binary '¸ÅÆ©',_binary 'ÁÂ¼® µÚÂÊ¿¡´Â ³«ÇÏ»êÀÌ ÀÖ´Ù. ³«ÇÏ»ê Âø¿ë¹ýÂëÀº ¾Ë°í ÀÖ°ÚÁö?',''),(4405,_binary '¸ÅÆ©',_binary 'ÀÓ¹«¸í·É¼­¸¸ °®°í ¿À¸é, 10ºÐ ³»¿¡ ¿øÇÏ´Â °÷¿¡ ¶³¾î¶ß·Á ÁÖÁö.',''),(4406,_binary '¸ÅÆ©',_binary 'ÀÚÀ¯´ë°áÁö´ë´Â µ¿Á·°£ÀÇ ´ë°áÀ» À§ÇÑ \'¿ÃÆ®\'¿Í µ¿Á·,Å¸ Á¾Á·¿¡ °ü°è¾øÀÌ ÀÚÀ¯ ´ë°áÀ» Áñ±æ ¼ö ÀÖ´Â \'¹Ù³ªÅø\'ÀÌ ÀÖ´Ù. ¿øÇÏ´Â Àå¼Ò¸¦ ¼±ÅÃÇÏ°Ô³ª.',_binary '¿ÃÆ®·Î °¡°í ½Í½À´Ï´Ù.\r\n**¹Ù³ªÅø·Î °¡°í ½Í½À´Ï´Ù.\r\